## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Contact Default (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Corrosion Scythe, War Axe, Oracle, Queen's Wings, Immortality
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, War Axe, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when crowd control, slows, or magic poke matter more than early physical lane trades.; Dominance Ice over Oracle when Use when the enemy sustain fighter or attack-speed carry has to hit you during the brawl.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use against burst magic that can remove you before Vengeance and ultimate healing stabilize the fight.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use against repeated physical skill burst from EXP laners or assassins that must enter your range.
- Total cost: 11100 gold

Default EXP setup for long melee fights where Thamuz needs Corrosion Scythe contact, War Axe uptime, and enough healing amplification to stay in range.

### EXP Flicker Chase (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Corrosion Scythe, War Axe, Brute Force Breastplate, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, War Axe, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical lanes when the enemy lacks reliable control and the first Turtle fight is mostly front-to-front.; Dominance Ice over Oracle when Use when anti-heal and attack-speed reduction are more important than amplifying Thamuz's own recovery.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against repeated magic damage that stacks across Lord fights instead of one burst combo.; Blade Armor over Oracle when Use when a basic-attack marksman is forced to hit you before they can reach your back line.
- Total cost: 10700 gold

Reach-focused EXP build for games where Flicker and Brute Force movement let Thamuz cross one extra gap after the enemy escape spell is spent.

### Jungle Tempo Bruiser (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff, Queen's Wings, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Seasoned Hunter, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when jungle duels and physical skirmishes matter more than CC duration reduction.; Demon Hunter Sword over Queen's Wings when Use only when your team already has front line and you need faster objective burn into high-HP targets.; Oracle over Golden Staff when Use when the game needs a second bruiser front line more than extra attack-effect pressure.; Dominance Ice over Queen's Wings when Use when enemy sustain, shields, or attack-speed damage will decide Turtle and Lord contests.
- Total cost: 11220 gold

Jungle variant for tempo games where Thamuz farms War Axe first, uses Ice Retribution to stay attached, and converts basic-attack uptime into objective control.

